Subject: [PATCH 1/2] test(examples): pin the wrapped A-axis catalog
 requirements

Keep the missing-case regression test for the next worker.
The pin fails on upstream/main because wrapped.camproj is absent.
Rotary Contour refuses an X-axis workpiece. Issue #3000 tracks this limit.
No catalog assets or generator changes are included.

Refs #2869
